<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - ICI trimmed at Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ICI trimmed at Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earnings estimates for Imperial Chemical Industries Plc were cut at Merrill Lynch, market sources said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>For 1996 Merrill cut its pre-tax profit estimate to 650 million stg from 700 million and for 1997 it cut to 780 million stg from 900 million, sources said. The brokerage repeated a &quot;neutral&quot; rating on the stock.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage would not comment. The stock was up 4-1/2p at 825 by 1425 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
